    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">The journey</p>
      <h2>Three things the desert <em>gives back</em></h2>
      <p class="head-note">Eleven hours with nothing to do but watch the dunes turn from gold to silver. We built the train around that quiet.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid3">
      <article class="card reveal">
        <span class="card-num">01</span>
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M29 7a17 17 0 1 0 12 24A14 14 0 0 1 29 7z"/>
            <circle cx="36" cy="13" r="1.4" fill="currentColor"/>
            <circle cx="41" cy="22" r="1" fill="currentColor"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Sleeper berths that feel like rooms</h3>
        <p>Every berth has blackout linen, a reading lamp and a window that opens onto the dunes. The bed folds down at dusk and stays made until the desert ends.</p>
        <div class="meta"><div><b>2.0 m</b>berth length</div><div><b>Quiet</b>car, 24 hrs</div></div>
      </article>

      <article class="card reveal d1">
        <span class="card-num">02</span>
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="16"/>
            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="8"/>
            <path d="M24 8v4M24 36v4M8 24h4M36 24h4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>An observation car with no ceiling lights</h3>
        <p>The rear car is glass from floor to dome. Lights are dimmed after midnight, so the Milky Way comes through and the dunes glow faintly underneath.</p>
        <div class="meta"><div><b>360&deg;</b>glass dome</div><div><b>Open</b>all night</div></div>
      </article>

      <article class="card reveal d2">
        <span class="card-num">03</span>
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
