        <h3>Dusk dining, cooked for the cold hours</h3>
        <p>Slow braises, flatbreads from the onboard oven and mint tea poured at the table. The galley closes at 3&nbsp;a.m., and a warm supper is always waiting for late boarders.</p>
        <div class="meta"><div><b>3 courses</b>served nightly</div><div><b>Local</b>ingredients</div></div>
